<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Restoration Druids in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-restoration-druid-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_mage_runeofpower.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Restoration Druid gear?</h3>With many different sources of gearing and loot scarcity in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list of ideal Restoration Druid drops found in Phase 3 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, you'll often supplement it with gear from other sources, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Restoration Druids</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Restoration Druids</h3>The overall best in slot list includes only Throne of Thunder options though close alternatives exist in other content types.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width">
<div id="dsf67g4d-bis-lists">
<div class="tabs-container">
<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" data-href="#bis-lists-phase-3-bis" data-selected="true" role="tab" tabindex="0">
<div>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/achievement_boss_leishen.jpg");'></span>Phase 3 BiS</div></button>
<div class="vertical-scroll-shadow"></div>
<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-3-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">Item level remains particularly powerful so expect to wear your highest level gear in most slots, with exceptions for tier pieces and sometimes trinkets. Gear is also more random in Throne of Thunder since all items have a chance to Thunderforge to a higher item level. You might end up equipping a higher ilvl item that isn't on your best-in-slot list. <br/>
