<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Restoration Druids in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses available in Phase 3 are a <b>major upgrade</b> for Restoration Druid. This is our best tier set all expansion!<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15">
