<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94520/inscribed-bag-of-hydra-spawn">
<img alt="Inscribed Bag of Hydra-Spawn" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_creature_poison_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Bag of Hydra-Spawn</span></a> <i>(Megaera, Throne of Thunder)</i> - The trinkets healing proc does reasonable numbers, but it's greatly hurt by its passive Spirit since similar trinkets with passive Intellect are just a lot stronger.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94525/stolen-relic-of-zuldazar">
