<img alt="Zen Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_scorchedstone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zen Alchemist Stone</span></a> <i>(Alchemy BoP)</i> - The Alchemist Stone is a fantastic starter trinket if you're an Alchemist.</div></li></ul>
