<del></del></span> Reputation for Restoration Druids in Phase 3</span></h2>Reputation gear is of quite high item level (even higher than Celestial Dungeons) but costs <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, which is limited. In Phase 3 you can mostly ignore reputations outside of Shado-Pan Assault since they take quite a while to grind to a good reputation level and catch up gear is better anyway.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
